From: Kevin Finisterre <kfinisterre@KevinsMacStudio.localdomain>
Subject: [PATCH] the gain set by hand kept when the tuner is initialised again

Turning direct sampling off initialises the tuner again (_rtlsdr_set_direct_sampling:
tuner->init), and an R820T comes back with its LNA and mixer on its own AGC while
dev->gain still reports the gain set by hand. With an R820T that happens on the first
tune after rtlsdr_open: rtlsdr_set_sample_rate's bandwidth step (r820t_set_bw) tunes to
the frequency the stick has, 0 Hz, which turns direct sampling on, and the first real
tune turns it off again. So every program that sets the rate, the gain, then the
frequency (rtl_power, x6x00-rtlspec) ran at the tuner's own gain whatever it asked: on
the bench X6200 (2026-11-22, an R820T at 145 MHz) 0 dB asked read -9.4 dBFS, the level
of 49.6 dB, and -48.3 dBFS once set again after the tune. Now the manual gain is set
again after the tuner's init; rtlsdr_set_tuner_gain_mode keeps the mode for that. The AGC
case is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
--- a/src/librtlsdr.c
+++ b/src/librtlsdr.c
@@ -113,6 +113,7 @@
 	uint32_t offs_freq; /* Hz */
 	int corr; /* ppm */
 	int gain; /* tenth dB */
+	int manual_gain; /* rtlsdr_set_tuner_gain_mode's last: the tuner's gain set by hand, not its AGC */
 	struct e4k_state e4k_s;
 	struct r82xx_config r82xx_c;
 	struct r82xx_priv r82xx_p;
@@ -1108,6 +1109,8 @@
 		r = dev->tuner->set_gain_mode((void *)dev, mode);
 		/*rtlsdr_set_i2c_repeater(dev, 0);*/
 	}
+	if (!r)
+		dev->manual_gain = mode;
 
 	return r;
 }
@@ -1238,6 +1241,12 @@
 		if (dev->tuner && dev->tuner->init) {
 			rtlsdr_set_i2c_repeater(dev, 1);
 			r |= dev->tuner->init(dev);
+			/* The tuner initialised again has its gain on its own AGC: a gain set by hand before (the first tune
+			 * after rtlsdr_open comes here, the sample rate's bandwidth step having tuned to 0 Hz) is set again */
+			if (dev->manual_gain && dev->tuner->set_gain_mode && dev->tuner->set_gain) {
+				dev->tuner->set_gain_mode((void *)dev, 1);
+				dev->tuner->set_gain((void *)dev, dev->gain);
+			}
 			rtlsdr_set_i2c_repeater(dev, 0);
 		}
 
